
# RoadGuard - API Documentation

## Overview
RoadGuard uses REST APIs to allow communication between the frontend and backend.

## Planned API Endpoints

| Method | Endpoint | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| GET | /api/reports | Retrieve pothole reports |
| POST | /api/reports | Submit a new report |
| GET | /api/reports/:id | Retrieve a specific report |
| PUT | /api/reports/:id | Update a report |
| DELETE | /api/reports/:id | Delete a report |
| GET | /api/health | Check backend status |

## AI Service
The AI service is planned to analyse submitted images and return pothole detection results.

## Expected Response
API responses should use JSON format.

## Notes
These endpoints are proposed for development. Actual routes and response formats must be confirmed with the backend team.

API documentation will be updated after implementation and testing.
